<title>MEXICO: Mexico Jan-Feb maquiladora empolyment up 18.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico Jan-Feb maquiladora empolyment up 18.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Employment in Mexico's maquiladora, or in-bond, sector rose 18.4 percent during the first two months of the year compared to the same period of 1996, the National Statistics Institute (INEGI) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>There were some 824,710 people employed in the maquiladora sector at the end of February, INEGI said in a statement.</p>
<p>((-- Monica Ballesca, Guadalajara newsroom +523 817-0397))</p>
